{"id":"b1e73bf35c4eb9e9","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-weakly-inaccessible.md","title":"Weakly Inaccessible","display":"df-weakly-inaccessible — Weakly Inaccessible","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-weakly-inaccessible","aliases":["58-df-weakly-inaccessible"],"display":"df-weakly-inaccessible — Weakly Inaccessible","depends_on":["[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-weakly-inaccessible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-weakly-inaccessible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weakly-inaccessible — Weakly Inaccessible"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span> (limit-ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeaklyInaccessible}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{WeaklyInaccessible}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (weakly-inaccessible-cardinal predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weakly-inaccessible} \\vdash \\mathrm{WeaklyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weakly-inaccessible} \\vdash \\mathrm{WeaklyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Weakly inaccessible cardinals are uncountable regular limit cardinals.</li>\n<li>If ZFC is consistent, it does not prove that a weakly inaccessible cardinal exists.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S$ (regular-cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-regular-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S$ (limit-ordinal predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeaklyInaccessible}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weakly-inaccessible} \\vdash \\mathrm{WeaklyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\omega<\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":true}],"bytes":1055,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1381","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-weakly-inaccessible.md|58-df-weakly-inaccessible]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["0fbfc19800246e77","81cabbac7fa4d75d"]}